      "description": "The ongoing breakdown of EU-level coordination in AI governance reaches a tipping point, with member states formalizing bilateral compute-sharing and security arrangements outside EU frameworks. The European Commission loses its role as coordinator, and de facto fragmentation becomes irreversible without treaty-level intervention.",
